## Usage

### Running the Application

```bash
python contact_book.py
```

Or make it executable on Unix/Linux/Mac:

```bash
chmod +x contact_book.py
./contact_book.py
```

### Using the Menu

```
==================================================
       CONTACT BOOK APPLICATION
==================================================

1. Add Contact
2. View All Contacts
3. Search Contact
4. Update Contact
5. Delete Contact
6. Exit

==================================================
```

